# Ghostly Dancers: "unlock a locked door of a Room you control": one door of one Room, chosen by Bot1, not a door of every Room.
# Bot1 has Unholy Annex (cast on turn 1) and Roaring Furnace (cast on turn 3), each with its other door locked, and no enchantment
# card in its graveyard (Black Lotus is an artifact): on turn 5 Ghostly Dancers can only unlock, and Bot1 picks Roaring Furnace, so
# Steaming Sauna unlocks (CR 709.5f) and "When you unlock this door" on Roaring Furnace stays unused, while Unholy Annex keeps
# Ritual Chamber locked. The Room fully unlocked (CR 709.5i) makes a Spirit through eerie, and Steaming Sauna's end step draws.

